World "Logic"
Title "Logic"

Introduction "
Mathematics is built from a few words: *if*, *and*, *or*, *not*, *for all*, *there exists*.

In Lean they are `→`, `∧`, `∨`, `¬`, `∀`, `∃`.
In this world you learn how to prove each one, and how to use each one.
"

Conclusion "
You can now handle every logical word. Time to build numbers.
"
